{"type":"text","timestamp":1785205112267,"sessionID":"ses_0597ce0ceffeLuq8qa50St50xj","part":{"id":"prt_fa6842a6f001wpoXW8CCRbPcUJ","messageID":"msg_fa6841f6d0017OdWGFFGEm8wYc","sessionID":"ses_0597ce0ceffeLuq8qa50St50xj","type":"text","text":"The difference of total amount spent by Student_Club between 2019 and 2020 is **2086.05** (2019 spent minus 2020 spent).\n\n**How it works:**\n- The `budget` table contains the `spent` column and links to `event` via `budget.link_to_event = event.event_id`\n- Using `SUBSTR(event_date, 1, 4)` to extract the year from `event_date`\n- Difference = SUM(spent) for 2019 − SUM(spent) for 2020 = **2086.05**\n\nFinal Answer: 2086.05\nEvidence SQL: SELECT (SELECT COALESCE(SUM(b.spent), 0) FROM budget b JOIN event e ON b.link_to_event = e.event_id WHERE SUBSTR(e.event_date, 1, 4) = '2019') - (SELECT COALESCE(SUM(b.spent), 0) FROM budget b JOIN event e ON b.link_to_event = e.event_id WHERE SUBSTR(e.event_date, 1, 4) = '2020') AS difference","time":{"start":1785205107311,"end":1785205112264}}}
